OL,4,BCamara to race again for Haas in Las   
OL,5,BVegas                                  
OL,6,GBrazilian Rafael Camara will race for  
OL,7,Gthe US-based Haas team for a second    
OL,8,Gtime at this weekend's Las Vegas Grand 
OL,9,GPrix.                                  
OL,11,FThe 21-year-old made his debut for     
OL,12,FHaas at the previous race, the Sao     
OL,13,FPaulo Grand Prix, alongside team-mate  
OL,14,FOliver Bearman.                        
OL,16,FCamara, who will become a full-time    
OL,17,Fdriver for Haas in 2027, is replacing  
OL,18,FFrenchman Esteban Ocon, who was sacked 
OL,19,Ffollowing an altercation with team     
OL,20,Fprincipal Ayao Komatsu at last month's 
OL,21,FMexico City Grand Prix.                
